    <briefdescription>
<para>Black-formula callable zero coupon bond engine. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Callable zero coupon bond, where the embedded (European) option price is assumed to obey the Black formula. Follows &quot;European bond option&quot; treatment in Hull, Fourth Edition, Chapter 20.</para><para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000007"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This class has yet to be tested.</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
